<title>ISRAEL: Two Israeli soldiers killed in south Lebanon.</title>
<headline>Two Israeli soldiers killed in south Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Israeli soldiers were killed and four wounded in south Lebanon early on Friday when a bomb went off near their patrol, security sources said.</p>
<p>They said the explosion occurred in Israel's 15-km (nine-mile) deep south Lebanon occupation zone where Islamic militants are fighting a guerrilla war to expel Israeli soldiers from the area.</p>
